window.products.push({"id":177007,"name":"Hot Air Popcorn Machine,No Oil Needed BPA Free1200W Electric Popcorn Maker, Household Popcorn Popper for Healthy Snacks, High Efficiency, DIY Your Own","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71b-yKCIqjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Enjoy a healthy, delicious popcorn with friends and family, perfect for Christmas, New Year! What is hot air? The principle of using hot air to cancel the fuel is used to heat, and the corn kernels are fried, which is simple, quick and healthier. Don't need any oil, make hot fresh popcorn in a healthy way! Flavor the popcorn with your favorite taste, such as sugar, chocolate, butter, sea salt, coconut oil, cheese, peanut butter, etc. The popping chamber of this product is designed in such a creative way that the air swirls inside and gives up to 98% perfect outcome. PACKAGE INCLUDES： 1 * Small Popcorn Maker 1 * User Manual 10 * Popcorn Paper 1 * Cup NOTE: 1. Please do not add any ingredients in the popper chamber to popcorns, which may result in a short circuit. 2. Please use fresh and dry kernels instead of stale and wet ones, otherwise, it is possible that some kernels will not be popped or need a longer time to pop. 3.Do not operate the popcorn maker for more than 5 minutes at a time. Allow a 5-10 minutes break between cooking the second cycle of popped corn. This will allow the motor to cool down. 4.Please use a large-size bowl when using the popcorn machine, and children need to be accompanied by their parents when operating. 5.Hot air popcorn popper maker works by hot air circulation, a small part of the corn kernels may be blown out during operation, which is normal. Please do not put your hands close to the air outlet to prevent burns!!! INSTRUCTIONS FOR USE: 1. Remove the transparent cover and, using the cup included, add the popcorn kernel into the center of the pop corn popper. 2.Replace the transparent cover and place the cup measure in the top of the pop corn popper. 3. Place the container in front of the popcorn machine popcorn exports to in","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71b-yKCIqjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Everbeauty","source_asin":"B08L8LLXPT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-177007","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08L8LLXPT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08L8LLXPT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
