window.products.push({"id":177058,"name":"MOPMS Upgrade Toothpaste Dispenser Gift for Women,Wall Mount for Bathroom Automatic Toothpaste Squeezer Hands Free for Kids and Adult,Blue,1PCS","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dEx5JC8ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【High Quality Material】 The Automatic Toothpaste Dispenser is made of environment friendly ABS material, no smell, durable and safe to use. toothpaste squeezer can provide you with a long-term service. 【Squeeze Quantitatively】The toothpaste dispenser with vacuum technology allows you to quickly, easily and neatly squeeze the appropriate amount of toothpaste directly on your toothbrush. 【Detachable and Easy to clean】The toothpaste dispenser for kids is detachable, each part of toothpaste dispenser can be removed for cleaning, don't worry about dirt, you can keep clean. 【Convenient to use】Automatic Toothpaste Dispenser Set is non-contact operation and free hand squeeze to get toothpaste, so it is hygienic and convenience, which is good for the kids and avoid wasting toothpaste. The toothpaste dispenser comes with 2PCS sticker, punch-free, stick it directly to the wall without damage. 【Beautiful Appearance】2021 upgrade Toothpaste Dispenser, new modeling, new craftsmanship, bright & transparent surface, round and exquisite appearance, add a beautiful scenery to your bathroom.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dEx5JC8ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MOPMS","source_asin":"B08ZKXF8WG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-177058","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZKXF8WG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZKXF8WG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":177059,"name":"Poppies II by Master's Art, 30x47-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":66.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Pr2HYk2qL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features red poppies. Masters Fine Art is a company that travels around the world to bring the best in fine art from outstanding artists from different lands. They believe that art is the sould of the world, that it represents our human essence.MFA works mostly with Latin American art. It portrays a happy view of life, represented with bright beautiful colors, music, dance, love, hope and happiness, giving us the feeling that we can overcome all hardships with all the beautiful things we still have in life. The art Masters FineArt carries is many things: colorful, contemporary, sexy, emotional, musical, romantic.Above all it is beautiful and full of joy. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece.The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame.This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Pr2HYk2qL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00BLY3K6K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-177059","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BLY3K6K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BLY3K6K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
