window.products.push({"id":177137,"name":"Panda Palm Vinyl Placemats Heat-Resistant Table Mats Washable Easy Clean Plastic Placemats for Dining Table Set of 4(Blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dgSTsrrbL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"❤ What are the characteristics of the placemat? ❶Simple and elegant placemats are more easier to match your family decoraction.❷Vinyl placemats is easy to clean.It haves more high quality feature,such as washable,heat-resistant and anti-skid.The PVC placemats is best choice to protect you table.❸A piece good placemat to make you feel good when you eat, improve your dining experience, and give your guests a better impression. ❹High-quality and PVC material,it can be cropped to any shape you want. Placemats are laid flat instead of rolled up so they don't deform easily ❤ How to take care of the placemat after use? ❶This type of placemat easy to replace and take care.❷Cleaned with clear water and dried in the shade.No need to wash repeatedly.❸Take care to prevent the sauce like ketchup from staying on the placemat for a long time.❹It's easy to clean, wipe with a damp cloth, or rinse with a small amount of detergent to make it look like new❤ Where can the placemat be used? Our placemats can be matched to a variety of styles of furniture and can be placed under the cups, cutlery, vases and ashtrays as an ornament for dining tables and coffee tables. Widely used in homes, hotels and business offices, conference tables, kitchen tables.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dgSTsrrbL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Panda Palm","source_asin":"B0B2D81714","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-177137","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2D81714","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2D81714","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":177138,"name":"The Rusty Roof-Distressed Cimarron White-Solid Wood Picture Frame-14x14","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QYY9iwbJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Featured is the Distressed Cimarron White Picture Frame, which is a hand made wood picture frame hand-painted and hand-distressed, made right here in the USA!.  Frame Moulding Width: Approx 1.5 inches. Frames up to 20x24 include glass, backing, and hangers. Frames larger than 20x24 include acrylic rather than glass, for safety. These frames are available in a wide variety of colors and sizes, and this frame is perfect for weddings and traditional decor.  We can make any size that you need, including the most common sizes, such as 4x6, 5x7, 8x10, 12x12, 11x14, and 16x20. Contact us with any questions or requests for a special size that we do not have listed.  You can choose the size you need, or change the color in the dropdown menu above.  Frame size is determined by the size artwork the frame will hold. For example, if your artwork is 8x10, choose an 8x10 frame. Our frames are sized by the inner dimension, not the outside measurement.  The visible area of the artwork will be 1/2 inch smaller than the size of the frame. For example, the visible area of an 8x10 frame is 7.5x9.5, due to the lip of the frame that holds in the glass and artwork.  Please note: various screens display colors differently, and actual color may vary slightly from what is pictured.  Please contact us with any questions, we look forward to doing business with you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QYY9iwbJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Rusty Roof","source_asin":"B0BSG4W8MX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-177138","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BSG4W8MX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BSG4W8MX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
