window.products.push({"id":177233,"name":"Mini Cake Pans with Lids,6.8 Oz Mini Loaf Pans with Lids Aluminum Foil Mini Loaf Baking Pans 100pcs Disposable Bread Pan Aluminum Foil Long Baking Cup","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YnXuCgJiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【MINI CAKE PANS WITH LIDS】The Mini Loaf Pans With Lids and sealing stickers which snaps on tight can keep food fresh and clean,ideal aluminum pans take-out container with lids and spoons for outdoor or indoor use，suitable for takeout, side dishes, pastries,camping and food service or fridge organizer 【HIGH-QUALITY ALUMINUM FOIL MINI LOAF PANS】Unlike other flimsy silver aluminum foil pans, our mini cakes pans is made with heavy-duty food-grade aluminum foil,not easy to deform,odor free, safe, featuring a smooth surface, waterproof and oil-proof and with good thermal conductivity, heat resistance, which and can shorten the baking time. High-temperatures resistance up to 220℃/428℉, can stand well in oven.The rectangle baking tins are oven ,microwaves and air fryer safe.(NOTE:The clear lids are not heat resistant) 【MINI LOAF BAKING PANS& RECTANGLE CUPCAKE HOLDERS】These bread pans can be used as a baking pan or exquisite cupcake holders with lids. Put them into the oven and bake them directly without baking tray required and use them directly as an cute cupcake holders without destruction the food 【DISPOSABLE&REUSABLE MINI LOAF PAN】Using this disposable ramekins with lids,no need to waste time cleaning the baking pans.You can simply throw those mini cake pans out after use or you can clean them for next use.And you can cooking multi-kinds of food in one time or one pot with these mini pans 【WIDE USAGE PARTY SUPPLIES 】 these Mini Baking Tins With Lids are suitable for roasting in grill, frying in air fryer and baking in oven and cook in steamer or microwave.They can be widely applied to hold cupcakes, puddings, mini brownies, pies, muffins, bread and cheesecake in picnic, camping, catering, club, wedding, family party, favor baking, birthday and all kinds of gathering. Such as Halloween, Thanksgiving, Christmas and New Year, Holiday celebration. Also ideal for restaurants, bakery, cake business, chef, and other catering venues. 【 LOVELY MINI PAN SET】 This lovely mini pan set includes 100pcs aluminum foil pans at 6.5”x2.5”x1.2”, 100pcs clear plastic lids, 100pcs disposable spoons and 100 sealing stickers.The lids and sealing sticker not only make it easy to carry out but also make your cake more delicate. The capacity of a 6.8oz rectangular tin foil pan is twice that of the traditional 3.5oz round tin foil pan, which avoids the food waste caused by the cup is too large and the inability to enjoy food as much as possible due to the cup being too small. 【SINCERELY AT YOUR SERVICE】 Please feel free to contact us if you have any problems about the foil mini loaf pans. We offer a 60 days refund service to help you get a great shopping experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YnXuCgJiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MooManGoo","source_asin":"B0BLVGZRVP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-177233","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLVGZRVP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLVGZRVP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
