window.products.push({"id":177269,"name":"Canomo 2 Sets Bottle Lamp Making Kit Includes All Adapters and Side Hole Lamp Socket Allow You to Make a Wine Bottle Lamp or Other Bottle Lamps, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71we8Ewp4ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"How to make a bottle lamp First, choose the rubber adapter that fits best in the neck of your bottle or vase. If the fit is not tight, you can later use super glue or hot glue to secure it properly. Next, screw your chosen adapter onto the steel threaded pipe, followed by the washer, exposing 1/4\" of the nipple.  Add the check ring (the disc which will cover the top of the bottle) on top of the washer.  Loosen the set screw on the socket and screw it onto the 1/4\" of the exposed nipple.  Place the socket into the opening of the bottle, using the rubber adaptor to create a tight fit. Here is where you can add some super glue, or hot glue to provide additional strength. Push the assembly down until only the socket cap is left showing. Package includes: UL-Listed Socket Black Off/On Socket with Side Exit Hole 3 Rubber Adapters to Choose From: 1 Inch, 3/4 Inch and 5/8 Inch 8 Foot Long Black Cord Steel Nipple (Threaded Pipe) Check Ring + Knurl Nut Illustrated Instructions to Guide You Through the Process","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71we8Ewp4ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Canomo","source_asin":"B0C15443WS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-177269","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C15443WS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C15443WS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
