window.products.push({"id":177311,"name":"RECYCO King Comforter Set, Lightweight Ultra Soft Down Alternative Quilted Comforter, Duvet Insert Bedding Sets with Pillow Sham for All Season, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618H4TC31oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"TOP COMFORT & WARMTH - RECYCO king size comforter set features a smooth, soft, and comfy feel, and provides a sweet look and chic style. Breathable and lightweight fabric keeps you warm without getting too hot and prevents night sweats. The classic design of solid color makes it easy to coordinate or enhance the style of your existing bedding sets and home decoration and promotes a sense of comfort, sweetness, elegance, and warmth. ULTRA SOFT FABRIC - Our king comforter set consists of super soft down alternative filling and pre-washed brushed fabric, which will become softer after each wash. It will not itch, stiffen, pill, or rip as easily as microfiber fabric, and will not wrinkle or shrink a lot like cotton fabric. The high-quality material makes our comforter soft, fluffy, cozy, skin-friendly, durable, anti-pilling, anti-linting, and non-shrink. PREMIUM QUALITY - This bed comforter king set applies a whole piece down alternative filling and adopts neat and firm stitching to prevent shifting and clumping. Tight seams and wrapped edges will also hold up and won't unravel through washing. Our duvet inserts comforter set is durable enough to last for years, not like others which will clump or rip easily. Buy with confidence! COMFY FOR ALL SEASONS - RECYCO white comforter set king size is designed to maximize comfort and helps you enjoy the utmost restful, relaxed sleep and siesta, making you feel like sleeping under a cloud, ideal for all seasons. Whether you are laying underneath or on top, it feels so soft and comfy. It is easy to maintain and machine washable on a cold and gentle cycle. Please line dry or tumble dry at low temperature. VARIOUS SIZES & COLORS - If you need an oversized comforter that drapes to the floor, please choose a larger size. Twin / Twin XL 2-piece comforter set: One lightweight comforter (68\" x 88\") and One sham (20\" x 26\"); Full / Queen 3-piece comforter set: One lightweight comforter (88\" x 92\") and Two shams (20\" x 26\"); King/Cal. King 3-piece comforter set: One lightweight comforter (92\" x 108\") and Two shams (20\" x 36\").","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618H4TC31oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RECYCO","source_asin":"B08Z6Z5RNL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-177311","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Z6Z5RNL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Z6Z5RNL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
