window.products.push({"id":177464,"name":"Handy Sandy Fold Flat Travel Wagon Reusable Grocery/Laundry/Cruise/Travel/School Locker Bag and More on Wheels, Lightweight (Orange)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":64.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816U+yZ6o5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LIGHTWEIGHT: Easy to travel and Go. Weighs 5 lbs. SPINNER WHEELS: 4 -360 degree Spinner Wheels. Our wheels are evenly balanced to get you to your destination with ease. SPACE SAVING AND EASY TO COLLAPSE AND STORE: Reduces down to 75% Space Saving. Fold down the Flap into the Bag Towards the Handle, Then fold down the opposite side towards the handle, Then Squeeze both sides into the center and fold down the handle wall towards the buckles. Snap the buckles. PERSONAL SHOPPING CART: USE INSTEAD OF SUPERMARKET CART MULTIPLE USE: Use it for craft, projects, shopping. teachers, whatever you may need to haul your items. DIMENSIONS: 20\"x15\"x10\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816U+yZ6o5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Handy Sandy","source_asin":"B08W3MR5GQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-177464","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08W3MR5GQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08W3MR5GQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":177465,"name":"Kalorik 200-Watt 4-in-1 Combination Stick Mixer, Black and Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41cMnG7R0+L._AC_.jpg","description":"Keep everything needed for quick food prep neatly organized and within reach thanks to this four-in-one combination stick mixer. The unit provides an ergonomic rubber handle for a secure grip and a long stem that reaches effortlessly into a pot for pureeing soup or into a drinking vessel for blending up protein shakes or fruit smoothies. Best of all, the appliance converts from a stick mixer to a whisk with a simple twist, or it can be attached to the included chopper for chopping up green pepper, onion, garlic, and more in seconds. The chopping container comes with a generous handle and a lid for conveniently storing food in the refrigerator. Finally, the unit supplies a milk-frothing attachment for making cafe-quality cappuccinos at home. The metal stick mixer with its entourage of accessories stores elegantly in the included arc-shaped base. Designed by the famous European designer Neil Currie, the four-in-one unit measures 9 by 7 by 16-1/2 inches and carries a one-year limited warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41cMnG7R0+L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kalorik","source_asin":"B000NO5TCW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-177465","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000NO5TCW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000NO5TCW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":177466,"name":"10 Pcs Wall Mounted Adhesive Hooks Stainless Steel S Shaped Door Hanging Holder Installation Non Screw Tile Wood Surface Waterproof Hanger Utensils fo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51j11HRUjsL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Specifications: Color: Silver Max loading: 15lbs Material: 304 Stainless Steel Product Size: 3.4 x 2.5 x 1.7 inches Back: Powerful self-adhesive Moisture-proof, Waterproof, Oil-proof No drilling,No tools,No Screw Package Includes: 10 pcs non-slip adhesive hooks How install the adhesive hook on wall 1. To ensure it holds well you have to clean the hooks surface from oil、dust、water, use for tile,metal or glasses surface. 2. Carefully remove the sticker from the surface with the adhesive on the hook without touching the adhesive with your hands. 3. Stick the hook on to the clean surface of your wall and press it hard to ensure firm. 4. To ensure that is sticks better let it sit for 24 hrs after installation without hanging anything on it. 5. It can be easily pulled down from your wall by heating the adhesive with a hair drier until it peels off the wall. Note: 1.It can work for Smooth ceramic tile,mirror, flat stainless steel,acrylic, plastic, laminate base and more. 2.There are limits on painted walls, it can damage the wall if the painted wall adhesive is poor. 3.This adhesive Stylish silver hanging hook is super versatile, ideal for foyers,organizes bedrooms, bathrooms, closets, offices, kitchens, entryway hallways and more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51j11HRUjsL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BITTO","source_asin":"B07P9HJXX6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-177466","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07P9HJXX6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07P9HJXX6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":177467,"name":"Yogibo Lift Top Coffee Table with Storage Compartments, Modular Base or Ottoman for Bean Bags, Dark Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Yzqeg4S7L._AC_.jpg","description":"Yogibo Lift Top Coffee Table with Storage Store, serve, and display home decor items on this ultra-convenient lift top coffee table with hidden storage compartments. This convenient storage coffee table features a clever lift top design that lifts up to reveal 4 inner compartments that makes it packed with storage possibilities. It provides an easy roomy access to store items such as books, magazines, and is sure to help clear the clutter. Tastefully crafted with a high quality upholstery fabric that exudes a sense of sheer elegance. To those with an eye for home decor, the Yogibo Lift square coffee table doubles up on both design and function. Super Versatile Ottoman Table This modern coffee table ottoman has a clean and contemporary silhouette with a spacious top and sturdy structure. Ideal as a decorative, yet functional coffee table accent with a super versatile design perfect to be placed in a living room, dorm room, office, or playroom. The great feature about this square coffee table for living room is that you can flip the top and use the lid as a laminated tray for serving. Perfect for serving food and drinks at your next game or movie night, and the best part of it all is that cleaning up will be a breeze. The Yogibo Lift coffee table measures 33.5in L x 33.5in W x 7.9in H. A Little About the Awesomeness of Yogibo Back in 2009, we set out on a mission to reinvent and breathe new life into the basic bean bag chair. To say consumers loved this fun, crazy concept would be an understatement! Fast forward to today, and we now carry a full line of creative, comfy furniture that loves you as much as you love it! Yogibo is seen all over the world in homes, schools, dorms, museums, and more!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Yzqeg4S7L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yogibo","source_asin":"B0865VMHM2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-177467","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0865VMHM2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0865VMHM2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
