window.products.push({"id":177560,"name":"PixiDoodle Custom Personalized Senior 2020 Graduation Coffee Mug (15 oz, Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+NMcKsXDL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Why not give that exceptional person a unique gift that says it all?Custom Personalized Senior 2020 Graduation mug - Fully Customize the Greeting and Closing lines of text. MAX 35 Characters per line. Both lines of text will be centered and appear in the same font as in example pictures. No one knows how hard of a year your high school student has had besides you. Uplift their spirits and tell them you believe in them and their struggles during the pandemic with this heartfelt, personalized message coffee cup.More Than Just a Coffee Cup!If you would like to spruce up the mug even more, add special treats the recipient might enjoy. Coffee, teas, candies, flowers, or any small items add more uniqueness to your special gift.Carefully Packaged QualityThis high quality ceramic mug design will never fade and is easily cleaned in the dishwasher and can be microwaved. Protective packaging ensures your gift will arrive intact.Get Your Mug Today!*Please note that the actual colors and placements may vary slightly from those seen in the listing photos. While we pour all our love into each item, the hand-crafted nature of these products may produce minor imperfections and inconsistencies.Copyright PixiDoodle TM","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+NMcKsXDL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PixiDoodle","source_asin":"B086S24Z64","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-177560","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086S24Z64","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086S24Z64","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":177561,"name":"Brage Living Swivel Gaming Chair Ergonomic High-Back Racing Style PU Leather Office Chair with Headrest and Lumbar Support and Adjustable Armrest (Adm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":100.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71N3ZQTQUgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our highest-ranking chair, the Admiral ergonomic gaming and desk chair from Brage Living delivers more features and benefits than any other chair in its class. Empowering you to perform at your highest level, the Admiral’s sleek, efficient form features 360-degrees of swivel, a full 90 degrees of reclining tilt with adjustable tension and a wide range of backrest and armrest locking positions. The Admiral’s armrests are height adjustable and feature vertical axis rotation to give you more options for the support of your elbows and arms. And when you need to stretch out, the Admiral’s seatback reclines a full 90 degrees so your can get horizontal and fully relax your back muscles. With generous padding all around to help you stay comfortable for hours of top performance, this chair features removable headrest and lumbar pillows that move where you need them to reduce help spine fatigue. As an added bonus, to help stimulate blood flow and engage your senses, the lumbar pillow includes built-in vibrating massage mechanism with power cord adaptor. To accommodate gamers of all shapes and sizes, the Admiral boasts a full four inches of height adjustment from 18.5 to 22.5 inches, activated by a state-of-the-art Class 3 gas lift, so everyone can work at their optimal seating level. Admiral’s intimidating style is available in a variety of bold color combinations to coordinate with any interior décor theme. The foam-filled leatherette upholstery is easy to care for while the heavy-duty metal frame and five-point nylon base support up to 300 pounds with stability that moves you on smooth-rolling swivel-mounted casters. All of these features combine to make the Admiral our most versatile and comfortable seating option, so you remain at your tactical best over long hours of gaming sessions or just navigating the Internet. A great choice for the pro gamer!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71N3ZQTQUgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Brage Living","source_asin":"B07H9T29CB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-177561","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07H9T29CB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07H9T29CB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
