window.products.push({"id":177566,"name":"Teacher Blanket Gifts for Women - Lightweight Soft Blankets for Teacher Appreciation Teacher's Day Birthday Back to School Graduation Gift Ideas 60\"X5","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.78,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NDMmCspaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Warm Present For Teachers】To my nice teacher, for guiding me thank you and taught me about knowledge love freedom, you are a special teacher who taught me with your heart, thanks for all that you do, how sweet it is to be taught by you. Teacher appreciation gift. 【Gift Ideas for Teachers】If you are struggling to find the perfect gift for your teacher, school/kindergarten/online teacher or teacher's friends/relatives, this blanket is sure to make them feel special. Blanket is a comfort item that leaves us feeling hugged without the hassle of having to be with a person. A great way to commemorate a special teacher friend or loved one in your life. 【A Special Blanket For A Special Person】This teacher blanket makes a unique gift for your teacher gifts for women, for a new teacher, daycare teacher, art teacher, teacher friends. A perfect gift for a teacher on teacher appreciation week, new teacher day, or the first day of school, can be used as perfect presents for New School Day, teacher's Day, back to school, teachers birthday, Graduation, Christmas, Thanksgiving Day, New Years, end of year gifts. 【Perfect Choice for Snuggling】The personalized teacher blanket is perfect as a snuggle blanket, nap blanket, office chair lap blanket, sofa blanket, bed throw, outdoor travel blanket, adult blanket, etc. The fluffy soft blanket with design keeps teacher warm and cozy while taking a nap, watching TV, reading a book, relaxing on a recliner, sleeping in bed, traveling and camping. This love blanket is a perfect gift for teacher. 【Blanket For Teachers】 This soft throw blanket is lightweight, cozy, fluffy, doesn't shed, made by polyester, it touched so softly and comfortably. It measuring 60x50 inches. This size data is due to different measurement methods, and the error within 2-4cm is a normal phenomenon. Amaze your teacher with the teacher appreciation gifts of an exquisite teacher throw blanket.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NDMmCspaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dvtqtiqpa","source_asin":"B09VDHSK3X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-177566","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VDHSK3X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VDHSK3X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":177567,"name":"HOME-X Butter Spreader for Corn on the Cob, Yellow Kitchen Accessories and Tools","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cAMwlT5PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EASILY SPREAD YOUR BUTTER: Adding butter to your corn on the cob can be a tricky endeavor. It’s known to slip and slide off the cob, creating a mess on the table or even your lap! With our butter spreader, you don’t need to deal with that anymore. It’ll help you smoothly apply your butter with no drips or messes. A KITCHEN ESSENTIAL: You’ll find yourself using this handheld butter spreader every day. It’s not just limited to corn on the cobs though. You can also use it for waffles, pancakes, biscuits, and anything else that needs to be buttered. This butter spreader comes in a small, compact size, making it perfect for storage. Just stow it away in your drawer, cabinet, or pantry when you’re done with it. EASY TO USE: We’re all about making your life simpler, which is why we made this butter spreader easy to use. First, slice off a square of either soft butter or margarine, depending on your preference. Then, insert the square into the cubed part of the butter spreader. Once it’s inside, place the spreader over your corn cob. Then, squeeze the lever. The butter will dispense smoothly. GREAT FOR OUTDOOR PARTIES: Grill outs and BBQs aren’t complete without corn on the cob! However, you need something for your guests to spread butter on their cob. Don’t settle for a plain old butter knife. Instead, use our butter spreader. This unique utensil is specifically designed to make spreading butter easier. KEEP YOUR HANDS CLEAN: Tired of greasy hands after you butter your food? We’ve got a solution for you! This useful gadget makes it so that your hands stay clean when applying butter to your food. Finally, no more sticky hands! This butterer is also easy to clean, making it entirely reusable. Just hand wash with soap and water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cAMwlT5PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home-X","source_asin":"B07RZHSX17","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-177567","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RZHSX17","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RZHSX17","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
