window.products.push({"id":177666,"name":"NOVICA Brown And Gold Cotton Wood Batik Jewelry Display Organizer 'Tegalalang Heritage In Brown'","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81e-NaYI+PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NOVICA, in association with National Geographic, works together with talented artisan designers around the world to produce stunning, keepsake treasures. Our mantra is to spread global happiness, so rest assured - we’ll do everything we possibly can to ensure you’re a happy customer.  About this item: Show off your beautiful jewelry in gallery style with this admirable wall display stand by Komang Sulaksana. He hand-carves the jewelry display panel of seasoned jempinis wood and finishes it with a weathered brown hue. The panel is centered by cotton printed with the traditional batik motifs in shades of cream and black over a golden background. The jewelry display panel includes a net over the cotton part for hanging earrings, and a rod on the top is designed for bracelets and/ or necklaces. There's a practical shelf over 10 stainless steel hooks, and two more hooks flanking the earrings. Rod is designed to lift up.  - Hand-crafted item -- color, size and/or motif may vary slightly   About our Artist: Komang Sulaksana comes from Tegalalang, where learned to make various kinds of handicrafts. 'Creating new designs is so much fun. Arranging different kinds of materials together is not a hard thing to do but, of course, it requires patience and skill. I mostly I use mostly use natural materials like banana bark, hibiscus leaves, lamtoro palm and recycled paper.'","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81e-NaYI+PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOVICA","source_asin":"B01JKGA1FI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-177666","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01JKGA1FI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01JKGA1FI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
