window.products.push({"id":177723,"name":"CHUN YI Stretch Armless Sofa Slipcover Removable Machine Washable Furniture Sofa Cover (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.92,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gpLly6VcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Spandex Fabric,polyester SUPERIOR FABRIC: 85% polyester 15% spandex fabric makes our sofa covers more stretchy and durable, ensuring both good function and comfort. Guarantee your new sofa from daily wear and tear, extending the life of your sofa, and also give your favorite old sofa a new rejuvenated look instead of buying a completely new one. FIT JUST RIGHT: CHUN YI armless sofa slipcovers fit the sofa back length from 180cm to 230cm. Easy to put on and take off with a one-piece design. Please measure your sofa in advance and compare it to our size chart. If you are not sure about how to choose, contact us and we will help you with all our heart. STAY IN PLACE: Our armless sofa cover covers the whole back of your sofa, providing all-around maintenance. Stretchy material makes installation very easy. Feature Strips, making the sofa cover tightly adherent to your sofa. For detailed installation steps, please refer to our install instructions in the package or feel free to contact us. WORK WELL: If you want to change the style of your sofa or home decor and do not willing to buy a new one at an expensive price, then a chic sofa cover would be a wise choice. They can prolong the service life of your sofa in the simplest way. EASY CARE: Machine washable and wash in cold water. Note Please: Because of the different light and different computer screen resolution, the color showed on the screen may be slightly different from the actual item.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gpLly6VcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHUN YI","source_asin":"B09TTQX5WH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-177723","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TTQX5WH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TTQX5WH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":177724,"name":"LUCKBOOSTIUM Metal Alloy Flower Evil Eye Ornament Lucky Charm w/Crystal Stone & Hanging Blue, Black & White Evil Eyes - Avoid Bad Energy at Home - Car","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6100HrJfuUL._AC_SL1353_.jpg","description":"\" Luckboostium flower and evil eye charm pendant - surround yourself with good energy stylishly That sensitive colleague, a frenemy or a road bully. Protect yourself from life's various bad energy with this flower and evil eye decor. 1. Steeped in history and tradition Charms and decorations with eye-like symbols, known as Nazars, are commonly used in many cultures around the world to dispel or deflect bad energy. The Nazar charm is an \"\"eye\"\", often set in a blue background, stares back at the world to keep you safe from harm. 2. Beautifully crafted The Luckboostium flower and evil eye pendant is a reflection of exotic chic in its intricately crafted metallic alloy accentuated by a flourish of vibrant blue and white of evil eye beads. You'd love hanging it in your vehicle, on your bag and favorite room at home! 3. A meaningful gift If you're looking for a unique surprise for a friend who is spiritually inclined, give a gift of protection and style with these flower and evil eye charms. \"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6100HrJfuUL._AC_SL1353_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LUCKBOOSTIUM","source_asin":"B08R6J19WY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-177724","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R6J19WY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R6J19WY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
