window.products.push({"id":177754,"name":"VeeCano 36X54 Inch New Clear Coffee Dining Table Protector Plastic PVC Tablecloths for End Side Sofa Buffet Table Top Topper Heat Resistant Easy Clean","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6168h0DPHXL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"🟡【UPGRADED CLEAR PROTECTOR MAT】VeeCano New Clear Table Cover, PVC table top protector is Eco- friendly & BPA free, non-toxic and odorless. Water and oil proof, wipeable with round corner design. Maximum heat resistance is up to 176°F/80°C, the heavy duty plastic vinyl table cover mat is safe for families with kids, pregnant women and the elderly. It can be used as dining room table protector cover, plastic cover for kitchen table, coffee table cover, plastic side table protector, desk cover. 🟡【THICK VINYL CLEAR TABLECLOTH】VeeCano thick clear table protector acrylic table mat is heavy enough to stay in place, easily protect your coffee dining kitchen end picnic outdoor bedside pub office kids writing tabletops from scratches, coffee spillage, scuffs, oil stains, heating scalds etc. It is easy to clean with a damp cloth. Our high transparent plastic tablcloth protect your expensive tabletop from damaged, keep it clean and tidy, and show off the original beauty of your table. 🟡【MULTIPURPOSE CLEAR TABLE PAD】The Crystal Clear PVC Tablecloth Table Cover Protector is perfect for wooden glass marble granite table, ideal for our daily use as office desk pad, kitchen table mat, dining room table top protector, TV table mat, hard floor mat, picnic changing table cover, end table runner cover, conference table protector, pet feeding mat, buffet table protector, laptop table top protector. The clear table pad is better for textured tabletops or on top of a tablecloth. 🟡【CUT TO FIT & WARM TIPS】✔1. We cut the mat slightly bigger than actual size for margin of shrinkage and deviation, it's not quality issue. If cut work needed, use pencil for remarks firstly then cut it with scissors. ✔️2. ATTENTION: For glass, marble, or other smooth table tops, please place tablecloths below to avoid air bubbles. WE DO NOT RECOMMEND TO PLACE THE CLEAR PAD ON A BRAND NEW WOODEN TOP, you can COVER IT ON A TABLECLOTH when your wooden top is new or just painted. 🟡【VeeCano QUALITY ASSURANCE】24/7 Hours Customer Service. CONTACT US FIRST if you are not satisfied with our table pad, REFUND OR REPLACE AVAILABLE. As the new clear table pads are rolled packed, so it will be a little wrinkled and warped edge. The solution is : A. Heating it with a hair dryer to make it flat; B. Lay it in the sun for half an hour; C. Lay out in reverse-roll direction and put something heavy on top of it; D. Stick the double sided table dots between table and the protector.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6168h0DPHXL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VeeCano","source_asin":"B09TSVN3M4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-177754","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TSVN3M4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TSVN3M4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
