window.products.push({"id":177891,"name":"MARMINS 4 Pack Bra Washing Bags for Laundry, 7 x 7 Inches Bra Bags for Washing Machine, Lingerie Bags for Laundry (Thickened Sandwich Fabric)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DugvDWa1S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【DURABLE】- The stitches on the edge joints are tight and not easy to crack. Bra washing bags with sturdy supports on the top and bottom, no vertical support. 【PROTECTIVE CLOTHING】- Auto-lock zipper to prevent opening when washing. Zipper cover to prevent scratching the washer or dryer. The bra bag can prevent the bra from squeezing deformation and snagging. 【CLASSIFICATION AND STORAGE】- Bra can be stored when traveling to prevent extrusion deformation. 【PACKAGE INCLUDED】- Set of 4 bra laundry bags (7 x 7 inches).2 pink zippers,2 gray zippers. 【TIPS】- Please don't put too many clothes. Keep it at about 2 / 3 capacity,washing more smoothly. Please tuck the zipper<br> into the elastic.Use a neutral or acid detergent when cleaning, the alkaline detergent will accelerate the aging of fabric.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DugvDWa1S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MARMINS","source_asin":"B08GS8FXHY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-177891","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GS8FXHY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GS8FXHY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":177892,"name":"Alpaca Home | Destination Plaid 100% Baby Alpaca Throw Blanket (Seaside Plaid)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":185.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tK4YmEHjL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"TIMELESS DESIGN & EXCEPTIONAL QUALITY – Soft and luxurious, you’ll love our DESTINATION PLAID throw, hand crafted from 100% pure luxurious baby alpaca! Alpaca is one of natures most durable materials and it is designed to last, while softening further with use. Superior quality ensures consistent warmth and long-lasting style even with everyday use. 100% BABY ALPACA COMFORT – This throw doesn’t have synthetic materials of any kind, just comfortable, breathable pure baby alpaca you can snuggle up under. Amazingly light and breathable, yet extremely insulating, it will keep your body warm and cozy in any type of climate. Naturally flame-retardant, without the addition of chemicals and completely sheep’s wool-free, it is hypoallergenic and safe for everyone to enjoy. SUITABLE FOR ALL SEASONS - It’s a perfect lightweight spring/summer throw providing a gentle, comfortable layer however, it’s equally wonderful in the fall/winter because of its natural thermal properties. Alpaca breathes so no overheating, just comfortable thermal regulation, regardless of season. No lanolin, no scratchy wool feel! Alpaca is a unique wool that is completely hypoallergenic -smooth and natural, never causing a reaction. ETHICALLY & SUSTAINABLY SOURCED: All of our Alpaca wool is ethically sourced from small farmers, shorn from the animal annually. These animals live at around 14,000 feet elevation in the Andes mountain range and have an exceptionally low environmental impact leaving terrain intact. Alpaca requires no environmentally harmful chemicals to process their wool into yarn - safe for humans and the earth. PERFECT FOR HOME OR ON THE GO – Use this lovely throw indoors or out. Ideal for the patio, porch, den, living room or as a travel accessory. It can be used at home to decorate a favorite chair or make a bedroom a bit more inviting, and it makes a wonderful gift. Our limited-edition throws are woven in small batches where master weavers create and hand finish them with love. We are small family owned and operated business, since 1997 and stand behind the exceptional quality of everything we sell.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tK4YmEHjL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Alpaca Home","source_asin":"B07S5YNQF3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-177892","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07S5YNQF3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07S5YNQF3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
