window.products.push({"id":177954,"name":"Ecolunchbox Three-in-One Stainless Steel Two Level Bento Box With Snack Container Regular (1)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fArboKzhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE ORIGINAL THREE-IN-ONE CLASSIC BY ECOLUNCHBOX: Introduced to market in 2008, this double decker container with a nesting snack pod is built to last from 100% rugged and tested stainless steel. The ECOlunchbox Three-in-One holds a total of 4 cups (32 oz / 946ml) of food. When clipped together with the snack container inside the upper level, it measures 5 ½ inches long by 4 inches wide by 2 ¾ inches tall. NOT LEAK-PROOF: The container’s stainless steel lid is easy to use. There are no gaskets in this lunchbox’s design, so it’s not appropriate for packing wet foods that might leak. If you’re looking for a leak-proof food container, check out other products by ECOlunchbox, such as our Blue Water Bento Splash Box and Blue Water Bento Seal Cup Trio that have leak-proof silicone lids. 100% PLASTIC FREE, NON-BREAKABLE & BPA-FREE: Made from high-quality, food-safe stainless steel. Steel container is lighter than a comparable glass container and virtually non-breakable. ECOlunchbox stainless steel food containers, which are third party independently tested, are free of estrogen-mimicking toxins commonly found in plastic, such as BPA (bisphenol-A), BPS (bisphenol-S) and phthalates. DISHWASHER SAFE: All parts of our stainless steel bento boxes are dishwasher safe, including the lid! No need to hand wash lids separately from the container bases like with other brands with lids made from plastic or with embedded gunky gaskets. TRUSTED MISSION-BASED BRAND: California eco mom and environmentalist Sandra Ann Harris designed the original ECOlunchbox stainless steel food container more than 10 years ago to pack lunches for her family. The woman-owned company continues as a mission-based, family-owned business dedicated to helping people reduce their dependence on plastics for health and environmental reasons. We stand behind our products and offer a one-year limited warranty against manufacturer’s defects.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fArboKzhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ecolunchbox","source_asin":"B082M131DQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-177954","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082M131DQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082M131DQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":177955,"name":"DII Fall Kitchen Towels Decorative and Absorbent Cotton Jacquard Dish Towel Set, 18x28, Autumn Acorn Leaves, 3 Count","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.62,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91256Bn0LNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DII holiday dishtowels are must-own kitchen essentials for every household. Dishtowels come in a set and have a festive design which makes them perfect not only for holiday but also for everyday use. These dish towels are functional and decorative, own a set to help you create a fun holiday atmosphere in your kitchen. Towels are strongly constructed which makes them a long-lasting every day essentials. Our holiday dish towels are perfect to give as a gift or keep for yourself. Towels come in varies designs coordinate well with our aprons, tablecloths, and runners. 100% Cotton Dish Towels are ultra-absorbent, durable and handy for mopping up in the kitchen or anywhere else a spill may occur. Fast drying towels produce minimal lint and are great for drying dishes and glasses, as well as for general kitchen duty. With each wash, these towels become more absorbent, helping to clean up even the biggest. Makes a great basic kitchen essential with multiple colors for your choices to mix and match with your home and kitchen. DII dishtowels are made with high quality 100% cotton with tight knit allow for less lint on your glass or plates. The perfect dishtowel for your daily kitchen use for holding up to your tough kitchen grease, dirt, food and more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91256Bn0LNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DII","source_asin":"B09BV74YWG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-177955","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BV74YWG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BV74YWG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
